## Pricing

Plans and a full comparison: [Pricing](https://steel.dev/pricing).

- **Launch** ($0 per month + usage): Start for free with $30 of credits, and pay only for what your agents run. Includes $30 of credits, one time. 10 concurrent browser sessions; sessions up to 15 minutes; up to 3 seats; email and community support; no credit card needed.
- **Scale** ($250 per month + usage): Production capacity, stable identity, dedicated support. Includes $100 of credits every month. 100 concurrent browser sessions; sessions up to 1 hour; dedicated IPs at $5 each; dedicated Slack channel; HIPAA-ready BAA.
- **Enterprise** (Custom per month + usage): Your hardest workloads, with guarantees: custom rates, security and support. Includes custom usage credits. 1,000+ concurrent sessions; stealth browser; reserve browser pools; sessions up to 24 hours; support and uptime SLAs; enterprise SSO.

